5,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,We must prioritize stability over novelty. Recent delays show our reliance on external factors is a critical weakness.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I worry about how new schedules might isolate our quieter neighbors. Access is the heart of our mission.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,Funding structures often look fine initially but crumble later. We need to examine the long-term financial shape.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,Why do we always debate the sound of ideas instead of checking if they already failed here?,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I think we should check if our current team can actually handle more work.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@George, financial fragility is a form of external dependency. We need to know where the cracks are.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"@May, I agree. Past attendance data might show who we are already missing. Let's look at that.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,George,,"I will review the grant terms. If the money is conditional, the service is conditional.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,May,,"I’ll check the two old programmes. If they died quietly, we need to know why before we start again.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I will look at the volunteer register. I need to see if we have the people to support this.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Daisuke, staffing is internal, but supply chains are not. I will check the supplier delivery windows.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Yumi,,"I will also look at the bus links. If the bus doesn't run, the library doesn't exist for them.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,George,,"I will also check the running lines. If equipment fails, the budget fails.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,May,,"I will also check the winter road closures. If the road is closed, the service is closed.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I will also check the evening room bookings. I want to see if the demand is real or just assumed.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
