35,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,The delivery windows are tied to other clients. We are at the back of the queue.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Yumi,,The bus links are gone. The outreach data shows people were coming when we went to them.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,George,,"The grant is a twelve-month bridge. The equipment money was returned. We are borrowing time, not building capacity.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,May,,The old digitisation project died because nobody owned the indexing. The evening groups survived because the community ran them.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"The volunteers are there, but no one is trained to supervise them. The evening rooms are full, but the catalogue is empty.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@George, if the grant is a bridge, we are building on sand. I need to know the endowment terms.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Yumi,,"@May, if the community ran the groups, maybe we should stop trying to run everything ourselves.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,George,,"@Ryuji, the endowment is for capital, not operations. We cannot use it to pay for sessions.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,May,,"@Yumi, exactly. The records show the community model worked. The staff model failed. We should look at the associations.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I think we need to check the neighbourhood associations. If they are already doing this, we just need to connect.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Daisuke, if the associations are active, we can outsource the risk. I will check the tool certification.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Yumi,,"I will check the neighbourhood associations. If they are ready, we can just hand over the keys.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,George,,"I will check the volunteer register. If we have the people, we can fill the gap.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,May,,"I will check the evening room bookings. If the demand is there, we just need to open the doors.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,I will check the volunteer register. I need to see if we have the people to support this.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
