60,3,1,talk,Ryuji,,Option D relies on roads and vehicles. We know those fail. Option A relies on people. People are more reliable than trucks.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Yumi,,Option D brings the library to the people. The bus data says they need us to come to them.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,George,,"Option A is a recurring cost. Option D is a capital cost. The grant covers A, not D.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,May,,Option A matches the evening groups that survived. Option D matches the road closures that failed. The records are clear.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,Option A uses the volunteers we have. Option D needs drivers we don't. I... I think A is safer.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@George, if the grant covers A, we are not building on sand. We are building on a bridge that is actually there.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Yumi,,"@May, the outreach data shows people came when we went to them. But the bus links are gone. Option A can happen in the community centers.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,George,,"@Ryuji, the grant is for sessions. Option A is sessions. Option D is a vehicle. The money is shaped for A.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,May,,"@Yumi, the community centers are already running the groups. We just need to formalize it. Option A is the only one that fits the existing shape.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,I agree. The volunteers are ready. The rooms are full. Option A is the only one that doesn't break something else.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Ryuji,,I am convinced. Option A minimizes external dependency. The facilitators are internal or community-based. The risk is low.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Yumi,,I am happy. Option A brings the library to the people without needing a bus. It is kind and it works.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,George,,"I am satisfied. The funding is aligned. The cost is recurring, which is what the grant is for. It is the only sensible choice.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,May,,I am done. The records show this shape already works. We are not inventing anything. We are just acknowledging what is already there.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Daisuke,,I... I feel better. The volunteers are there. The supervision gap is small. Option A is the one we can actually do.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
